stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Hidden
    Hidden --> Loading : open file
    state Loading {
        [*] --> Rendering
        Rendering --> Typesetting : HTML ready
        state fork_state <<fork>>
        Typesetting --> fork_state
        fork_state --> MathJax
        fork_state --> Mermaid
        state join_state <<join>>
        MathJax --> join_state
        Mermaid --> join_state
        join_state --> [*]
    }
    Loading --> Visible : first frame painted
    Visible --> Watching
    state changed <<choice>>
    Watching --> changed : file event
    changed --> Loading : content differs
    changed --> Watching : mtime only
    Visible --> Printing : --print
    Printing --> [*] : PDF written
    note right of Visible
        revealWindow() calls show()
        only after the theme is applied
    end note
